Package: omni-term-ai
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: tmux (>= 3.2), neovim (>= 0.9.5), git, gcc, make, ripgrep, unzip, libsecret-tools
Maintainer: Frozen Packet <chuck.pitre@hotmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/coldcanuk/omni-term-ai
Description: tmux workspace with Neovim and AI tooling
 Omni Term AI is a tmux-based dual-tab workspace that launches a command
 center and a Neovim editor with a packaged configuration. API keys are
 read from the OS keychain via omni-secret (libsecret on Linux).
